OL,6,     FWhen Christopher's posh old
OL,7,     Fschoolmates arrive for the
OL,8,     FNational Debating Championships
OL,9,     Ffinal, the Scouse lads fear losing
OL,10,     Fhim to his old world. Instead, the
OL,11,     Fgroups begin to bond until a
OL,12,     Fdrunken factory break-in, crashed
OL,13,     Fforklift and night in the cells
OL,14,     Fforces Christopher to confront
OL,15,     Fwhere he belongs. Meanwhile,
OL,16,     FAnna's return fractures Aimee and
OL,17,     FWayne's alliance when she offers a
OL,18,     Fdifferent version of the past,
OL,19,     Fleaving Aimee torn between loyalty
OL,20,     Fto her dad and the mum she never
OL,21,     Fstopped missing
